## Interface: 16001
## Title: Pace's Quality of Life
## Notes: Small conveniences for WoW Forever: track or untrack every quest (or a whole zone) from the quest log, filter Looking For Group players by role, a quest tracker that follows your zone, who's in a community voice channel before you join it, each person's voice volume kept, party members' pets on the party frames, each computer its own Edit Mode layout, and a gold finder (what your recipes, the auction house, vendors and your bags are worth, and which recipes for sale are worth buying). Each can be switched off.
